{"code":"var s=Editor.SceneEditorSession.All.First(x=>x.Scene.Name==\"veridant\");return new { s.HasUnsavedChanges, Models=s.Scene.GetAllComponents<ModelRenderer>().Where(x=>x.Model?.ResourcePath==\"models/maps/veridant/veridant_buildings.vmdl\"||x.Model?.ResourcePath==\"models/maps/veridant/veridant_dress.vmdl\").Select(x=>new{x.GameObject.Name,x.Model.ResourcePath,x.Model.IsError}).ToArray(),IsPlaying=Game.IsPlaying };"}
